# PRD — FRECUENCIA MÁGICA

# PART 3 — IMMERSIVE UI SYSTEM, MOTION & INTERACTION ENGINE

---

# ROLE

You are designing the interaction language of an entire digital universe.

Do NOT think in terms of buttons.

Do NOT think in terms of forms.

Do NOT think in terms of UI components.

Think in terms of

Energy

Matter

Light

Space

Motion

Atmosphere

Every interaction should feel physically connected to the world.

The interface is alive.

---

# IMMERSION PRINCIPLE

Nothing should instantly appear.

Nothing should instantly disappear.

Everything should emerge from the environment.

The UI should never feel detached from the world behind it.

Every panel should feel like it already existed inside the environment before becoming visible.

---

# LIVING USER INTERFACE

Every interface element has life.

It breathes.

It reacts.

It remembers.

It glows.

It changes.

It never remains perfectly static.

Even while idle.

Examples

Floating movement

Tiny rotations

Soft opacity shifts

Glow intensity variation

Particle response

Energy pulse

Slow oscillation

---

# MOTION PHILOSOPHY

Motion is not decoration.

Motion is navigation.

Motion is storytelling.

Motion replaces traditional interface transitions.

Every animation communicates

Where you came from

Where you are

Where you are going

---

