Reimagine every interaction.

---

# PERFORMANCE CONSTRAINTS

The experience must remain technically feasible.

Target

60 FPS on modern desktop hardware.

Minimum

30 FPS on mid-range mobile devices.

Avoid excessive draw calls.

Reuse shaders.

Reuse particle systems.

Reuse textures.

Lazy load every Realm.

Unload hidden scenes.

Pause off-screen animations.

Respect the user's `prefers-reduced-motion` setting by offering a simplified animation mode without changing the narrative structure.

---

# THREE.JS STRATEGY

Use React Three Fiber only when it provides meaningful value.

Recommended uses

Astral Portal

Constellation Sphere

Floating Crystal

Particle Universe

Sacred Geometry

Planetary Navigation

Sky Dome

Depth Layers

Do NOT build the entire interface in WebGL.

The UI should remain HTML-first.

Three.js should enhance immersion, never replace accessibility.

---

# COMPONENT PHILOSOPHY

Every interactive object should exist as a reusable world component.

Examples

Portal

Artifact

Crystal

Floating Book

Astral Compass

Constellation Menu

Energy Ring

Sacred Button

Glass Panel

Memory Orb

Nebula Background

Particle Layer

Light Beam

These components must be composable and reusable across every Realm.

---

# FINAL CREATIVE DIRECTIVE

Forget websites.

Forget SaaS.

Forget mobile apps.

Forget dashboards.

Design Frecuencia Mágica as if Pixar, TeamLab, A24, Apple Vision Pro and a AAA game art department collaborated to build the world's first **interactive mystical sanctuary**.

The user should not remember clicking buttons.

They should remember **walking through light, discovering forgotten places, listening to silence and feeling that the universe itself was responding to them**.

---

# ABSOLUTE PRIORITY

If forced to choose between:

* a conventional but familiar interface,

or

* an unforgettable immersive experience,

choose the immersive experience **provided it remains understandable, performant and accessible**.

The objective is not to make the most beautiful website.

The objective is to create **one of the most memorable digital experiences ever designed**.
